{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Repline》是一款專注於舉重與力量訓練紀錄的 App，適合希望少花時間操作手機、多花時間在槓鈴上的訓練者。iPhone 與 Apple Watch 可全程同步，在手腕開始一組後手機即時顯示，反之亦然。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-50.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>專為舉重訓練而設的紀錄</h2>\n<p>先建立課表與範本，每次訓練直接套用；重量、次數與完成狀態一按即可記下，每組之間可設定休息計時。熱身組不計入正式組統計，另支援超級組與動作備註。Apple Watch 可獨立記錄整場訓練，並與 iPhone 全程即時同步。程式自動追蹤個人最佳成績，設動作庫與訓練歷史；資料只留在裝置，毋須帳戶或雲端。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-297-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-298-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-299-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-300-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-301-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Repline: Workout Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/repline-workout-tracker/id6791378677?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:42:17.187826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:20:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:20.982735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:20.982735+00:00","content_hash":"6272657187cb0a616323cde40c276947f3c412c5791c109f939290dd63bf1633","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}